msgid "Show tag buttons above the gallery"
msgstr "Näita galerii kohal siltide nuppe"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:465
msgid "Give images \"Gallery Tags\" in the Media Library (e.g. Weddings, Portraits). One button appears per tag used in this gallery, plus \"All\"."
msgstr "Lisa piltidele meediateegis „Galerii sildid“ (nt Pulmad, Portreed). Iga selles galeriis kasutatud sildi kohta tekib nupp, lisaks nupp „Kõik“."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:467
msgid "Loading"
msgstr "Laadimine"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:472
msgid "Show all images at once"
msgstr "Näita kõiki pilte korraga"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:473
msgid "\"Load more\" button"
msgstr "Nupp „Lae rohkem“"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:474
msgid "Load more automatically while scrolling"
msgstr "Lae kerimisel automaatselt juurde"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:477
msgid "Big galleries open faster when only the first images are shown."
msgstr "Suured galeriid avanevad kiiremini, kui alguses näidatakse ainult esimesi pilte."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:479
msgid "Images per batch"
msgstr "Pilte korraga"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:483
msgid "Filtering and \"load more\" are not available for the selected layout."
msgstr "Valitud paigutusel pole filtreerimist ega „Lae rohkem“ võimalust."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:489
msgid "Full-screen viewer with swipe, keyboard and zoom. Not used by the Before / After layout."
msgstr "Täisekraani pildivaatur libistamise, klaviatuuri ja suumiga. Paigutus „Enne / pärast“ seda ei kasuta."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:491
msgid "Open images in a lightbox"
msgstr "Ava pildid pildivaaturis"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:495
msgid "Show image title"
msgstr "Näita pildi pealkirja"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:497
msgid "Shown under the image. WordPress uses the file name as the title unless you change it in the Media Library, so this is off by default."
msgstr "Kuvatakse pildi all. WordPress kasutab pealkirjana failinime, kui sa seda meediateegis ei muuda, seepärast on see vaikimisi väljas."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:499
msgid "Show caption"
msgstr "Näita pildiallkirja"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:501
msgid "The \"Caption\" field from the Media Library. Images without a caption show nothing."
msgstr "Meediateegi väli „Pildiallkiri“. Ilma allkirjata piltide puhul ei kuvata midagi."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:503
msgid "Thumbnail strip"
msgstr "Pisipildiriba"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:507
msgid "Download button"
msgstr "Allalaadimisnupp"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:511
msgid "Share button"
msgstr "Jagamisnupp"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:513
msgid "Facebook, X, Pinterest and \"Copy link\" for the image being viewed."
msgstr "Facebook, X, Pinterest ja „Kopeeri link“ vaadatava pildi jaoks."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:515
msgid "Link to each image"
msgstr "Link igale pildile"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:517
msgid "The address bar shows a link (…#sg-12-1/4) that reopens the lightbox at that image, so visitors can bookmark or send it."
msgstr "Aadressiribale tekib link (…#sg-12-1/4), mis avab pildivaaturi sama pildi pealt, nii et külastaja saab selle järjehoidjasse panna või edasi saata."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:519
msgid "Slideshow button"
msgstr "Slaidiesitluse nupp"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:521
msgid "Advances automatically using the \"Slide delay\" from the Layout tab."
msgstr "Liigub edasi automaatselt paigutuse vahekaardil määratud „Slaidi viivituse“ järgi."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:527
msgid "Everything here is optional; leave fields empty for a full-width gallery without a frame."
msgstr "Kõik siin on valikuline; jäta väljad tühjaks, et galerii oleks täislaiuses ja ilma raamita."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:531
#, php-format
msgid "e.g. 800px or 80%. Empty = full width."
msgstr "nt 800px või 80%. Tühi = täislaius."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:535
msgid "Empty = as tall as the images need. A fixed height adds a scrollbar."
msgstr "Tühi = nii kõrge, kui piltidele vaja. Kindel kõrgus lisab kerimisriba."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:537
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Taust"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:541
msgid "Inner spacing"
msgstr "Sisemine vahe"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:545
msgid "Border"
msgstr "Ääris"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:553
msgid "Solid"
msgstr "Pidev"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:554
msgid "Dashed"
msgstr "Kriipsudega"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:555
msgid "Dotted"
msgstr "Punktiir"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:556
msgid "Double"
msgstr "Topelt"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:562
msgid "0 = no border."
msgstr "0 = ääriseta."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:573
msgid "Preview width"
msgstr "Eelvaate laius"

