msgstr "Telefon"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:578
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Värskenda"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:583
msgid "Gallery preview"
msgstr "Galerii eelvaade"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:584
msgid "Updates as you change settings. Nothing is saved until you click Update."
msgstr "Uueneb seadete muutmisel. Midagi ei salvestata enne, kui vajutad „Uuenda“."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-options.php:648
msgid "Add images in the \"Images\" tab to see a preview."
msgstr "Eelvaate nägemiseks lisa pildid vahekaardil „Pildid“."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:38
#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:39
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Alustamine"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:84
msgid "Full-screen viewer with swipe, keyboard and zoom, plus optional thumbnails, download and slideshow buttons."
msgstr "Täisekraani pildivaatur libistamise, klaviatuuri ja suumiga ning soovi korral pisipiltide, allalaadimise ja slaidiesitluse nuppudega."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:85
msgid "Tag images (Weddings, Portraits…) and let visitors filter the gallery with one click."
msgstr "Lisa piltidele silte (Pulmad, Portreed…) ja lase külastajatel galeriid ühe klõpsuga filtreerida."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:86
msgid "Big galleries show the first images instantly and load the rest with a button or while scrolling."
msgstr "Suured galeriid näitavad esimesi pilte kohe ja laadivad ülejäänud nupuga või kerimisel."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:87
msgid "Albums"
msgstr "Albumid"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:87
msgid "Show several galleries as cover cards; each one opens in the lightbox."
msgstr "Näita mitut galeriid kaanekaartidena; iga kaart avaneb pildivaaturis."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:88
msgid "Responsive & fast"
msgstr "Kohanduv ja kiire"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:88
msgid "Columns adapt to phones and tablets, images use responsive sizes, and scripts only load where a gallery is shown."
msgstr "Veerud kohanduvad telefonide ja tahvelarvutitega, pildid kasutavad kohanduvaid suurusi ning skriptid laaditakse ainult seal, kus galerii on."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:89
msgid "Live preview"
msgstr "Elav eelvaade"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:89
msgid "See every change instantly in the editor, at desktop, tablet and phone widths — before you save."
msgstr "Näed iga muudatust kohe redaktoris lauaarvuti, tahvli ja telefoni laiuses — enne salvestamist."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:90
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "Videod"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:90
msgid "Add a YouTube, Vimeo or MP4 link to any image and it plays in the lightbox."
msgstr "Lisa mis tahes pildile YouTube’i, Vimeo või MP4 link ja video mängib pildivaaturis."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:91
msgid "Share & link"
msgstr "Jagamine ja lingid"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:91
msgid "Every image gets its own link, plus optional Facebook, X, Pinterest and copy-link buttons."
msgstr "Igal pildil on oma link ning soovi korral Facebooki, X-i, Pinteresti ja lingi kopeerimise nupud."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:92
msgid "Protection & watermark"
msgstr "Kaitse ja vesimärk"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:92
msgid "Discourage right-click saving and show your name over the images."
msgstr "Takista paremklõpsuga salvestamist ja näita piltide peal oma nime."

