msgid "Choose a look"
msgstr "Vali välimus"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:144
msgid "Pick a layout or a one-click preset (Portfolio, Instagram, Products, Photography, Slideshow). The live preview updates as you go."
msgstr "Vali paigutus või ühe klõpsuga eelseade (Portfoolio, Instagram, Tooted, Fotograafia, Slaidiesitlus). Elav eelvaade uueneb jooksvalt."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:148
msgid "Publish it"
msgstr "Avalda"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:149
msgid "Click \"Copy\" next to the shortcode and paste it into any page, or add the \"Spartan Gallery Block\" in the block editor."
msgstr "Vajuta lühikoodi kõrval „Kopeeri“ ja kleebi see suvalisele lehele või lisa plokiredaktoris plokk „Spartan Gallery Block“."

