msgstr "Ainult valitud galeriid, selles järjekorras."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:238
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "Nõuanded"

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:244
#, php-format
msgid "Organize images with %s, then turn on \"Filter buttons\" in the gallery's Filter & Loading tab."
msgstr "Korrasta pilte %s abil ja lülita galerii vahekaardil „Filtrid ja laadimine“ sisse „Filtrinupud“."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:249
msgid "Write a Caption for an image in the Media Library to show it in the lightbox."
msgstr "Kirjuta pildile meediateegis allkiri, et see pildivaaturis kuvataks."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:250
msgid "For Before / After, add images in pairs: the 1st image is \"before\", the 2nd \"after\", and so on."
msgstr "Paigutuse „Enne / pärast“ jaoks lisa pildid paaridena: 1. pilt on „enne“, 2. „pärast“ ja nii edasi."

#: admin/class-spartan-gallery-welcome-dashboard.php:251
